{"about_the_game":"Elite Tanks is a (difficult) strategic game where the player must approach each level with caution. You must take the challenge of fighting through 100 levels while also running into 7 different type of enemies. On top of that, your goal is to go through all these levels and enemies while only having a limited amount of lives. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThroughout the 100 levels, you will face off the enemies in 4 different environments. In those environments, some of the objects will be destroyable. The player in some cases, in order to advance, must breakdown walls or any obstacle placed between them and the enemies. Only the best will manage to get to level 100.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1bd73e7e6806f368a9ddb20c368ec0c1041e6e32.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to the desert.","name":"Welcome to the desert.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263740/1bd73e7e6806f368a9ddb20c368ec0c1041e6e32.jpg"},{"icon":"b1ef3389f021e108b92b6f9001fd572c273c54f1.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to the desert, Soldier.","name":"Welcome to the desert, Soldier.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263740/b1ef3389f021e108b92b6f9001fd572c273c54f1.jpg"},{"icon":"e4a29c2969fef32d4babfc3aa080644f60a7d664.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome home.","name":"Welcome home.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263740/e4a29c2969fef32d4babfc3aa080644f60a7d664.jpg"},{"icon":"9125606cc1ceaf4c7e09ff4d00623719940fe997.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome home, Soldier.","name":"Welcome home, Soldier.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263740/9125606cc1ceaf4c7e09ff4d00623719940fe997.jpg"},{"icon":"d75da1bc3ee1d8b2c70e93229d1ffb11850eba14.jpg","localized_name":"Seems familiar...","name":"Seems familiar...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263740/d75da1bc3ee1d8b2c70e93229d1ffb1185